# Build context for the worker image (see Dockerfile). The image build only
# needs: pyproject.toml and the files it names (hatch_build.py, README.md,
# LICENSE, NOTICE), src/, templates/, skills/, CHANGELOG.md. Never list one of
# those here: the build fails without it, or installs a package without its
# licence (guard: tests/test_parallel_worker_image.py). Everything else is
# excluded to keep `docker build` fast and to keep local secrets/state from
# being sent to the Docker daemon.

# VCS / editor
.git/
.github/
.claude/

# Secrets — never leave the host
.auth/
credentials.yaml
credentials.yml

# Runtime state / generated output
.steppy/
output/
tests/e2e/

# Python caches / envs
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Node workspaces — the built player bundle is vendored at
# src/steppy/_player_bundle/, so packages/ isn't needed for the image build.
packages/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Project/dev files not needed to pip-install the steppy package
tests/
fixtures/
scenarios/
seed/
config.yaml
credentials.yaml.example
steppy.guide.config.ts
steppy-config.schema.json
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
SECURITY.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
NEW_COMMANDS.md
PROJECT.md
